{'symbol': 'CMI', 'date': '2021-12-14 18:10:00', 'title': 'CUMMINS INC. APPROVES SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM', 'text': 'COLUMBUS, IND.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ON DECEMBER 14, THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CUMMINS INC. (NYSE: CMI) AUTHORIZED THE COMPANY TO REPURCHASE UP TO $2 BILLION IN SHARES OF COMMON STOCK UPON COMPLETION OF ITS 2019 $2 BILLION SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM. "THE LATEST SHARE REPURCHASE PROGRAM REINFORCES OUR COMMITMENT TO DELIVERING STRONG RETURNS TO SHAREHOLDERS AND REFLECTS OUR CONFIDENCE IN OUR LONG-TERM PERFORMANCE," SAID TOM LINEBARGER, CUMMINS CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. ABOUT CUMMINS INC. C'}